    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> As of 6.0 this method overlaps with\n<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getHeaders()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getHeaders()</code></a> and therefore no longer returns request\nheaders. Use <a href=\"#getRequestHeaders()\"><code>getRequestHeaders()</code></a> instead for request headers.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 自 6.0 版本起，此方法与<a href=\"../ErrorResponse.html#getHeaders()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getHeaders()</code></a>重叠，因此不再返回请求头。请使用<a href=\"#getRequestHeaders()\"><code>getRequestHeaders()</code></a>来获取请求头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Thrown when the <a href=\"DispatcherServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>DispatcherServlet</code></a> can't find a handler for a request,\nwhich may be handled with a configured <a href=\"HandlerExceptionResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerExceptionResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "当 `<a href=\"DispatcherServlet.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>DispatcherServlet</code></a>` 无法找到请求的处理程序时抛出异常，该请求可能由配置的 `<a href=\"HandlerExceptionResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerExceptionResolver</code></a>` 处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructor for NoHandlerFoundException.",
      "translation": "NoHandlerFoundException 的构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the headers of the request.",
      "translation": "返回请求的标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the HTTP status code to use for the response.",
      "translation": "返回用于响应的 HTTP 状态码。",
      "count": 2
